# Copy to .env (gitignored). mise loads this file into the environment for
# every repo command (see mise.toml [env]). Optional — without it, trmnl
# previews fall back to static data.

# --- TRMNL live preview (trmnl/) ---
# Used two ways when previewing against live data (comment out the
# `variables:` block in trmnl/.trmnlp.yml first):
#   1. trmnlp resolves {{ env.SWIFTLY_API_KEY }} in trmnl/.trmnlp.yml to
#      build the Authorization header for the direct Swiftly poll.
#   2. trmnl/transform-src/transform.ts reads it directly via process.env as
#      a fallback, since trmnlp's local custom_fields_values (unlike
#      polling_url/headers) don't get {{ env.X }} resolved before reaching
#      the transform — see trmnl/README.md#preview-data.
#
# Also used standalone by explore/'s scripts if you copy this file there
# too (see explore/.env.example) and by nothing else — production installs
# never read this; TRMNL installers enter their own key as a plugin form
# field.
SWIFTLY_API_KEY=
